# Example settings for the frontend. This file is committed and holds no real values.
# To override a setting on your own machine, copy this file to .env.local
# (which git ignores) and edit that copy.
#
# VITE_API_URL is the base URL of the Mini-JAMMS API, with no path on the end,
# for example https://your-api.up.railway.app
# Leave it empty to use the default, http://localhost:8000 (the API running locally).
#
# On Vercel it MUST be set in the project's environment variables. The value is
# copied in when the site is built, so without it the live site would call
# localhost:8000 on each visitor's own machine, and after changing it the site
# has to be redeployed.
#
# Anything starting with VITE_ is copied into the JavaScript that every visitor
# downloads, so it is PUBLIC. Never put a password, key or other secret here.
VITE_API_URL=
